      "resume": "Electrotech continues its growth with expanded facilities.",
      "description": "<p>To boost productivity and support ongoing growth, Electrotech has completed another expansion — the second this year — aiming to become one of Canada's largest control panel manufacturing plants and a major player in the U.S. market. Proud of Team Electrotech!</p>"
